ck; width:32px; max-width:100%; vertical-align:middle; line-height:0;\"><img alt=\"Item Tile\" src=\"/images/TileItem.png?6b8d11\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" data-file-width=\"32\" data-file-height=\"32\" /></div></td>\n<td><div style=\"display:inline-block; width:32px; max-width:100%; vertical-align:middle; line-height:0;\"><img alt=\"Empty Tile\" src=\"/images/TileEmpty.png?f6a3e0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" data-file-width=\"32\" data-file-height=\"32\" /></div></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div style=\"display:inline-block; width:32px; max-width:100%; vertical-align:middle; line-height:0;\"><img alt=\"Empty Tile\" src=\"/images/TileEmpty.png?f6a3e0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" data-file-width=\"32\" data-file-height=\"32\" /></div></td>\n<td><div style=\"display:inline-block; width:32px; max-width:100%; vertical-align:middle; line-height:0;\"><img alt=\"Empty Tile\" src=\"/images/TileEmpty.png?f6a3e0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" data-file-width=\"32\" data-file-height=\"32\" /></div></td>\n<td><div style=\"display:inline-block; width:32px; max-width:100%; vertical-align:middle; line-height:0;\"><img alt=\"Empty Tile\" src=\"/images/TileEmpty.png?f6a3e0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" data-file-width=\"32\" data-file-height=\"32\" /></div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div></div></div></div></div>\n<p>Adamantite Ore is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Mineral_Type_Items\" title=\"Category:Mineral Type Items\">Mineral</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Ranged_Weapon_Type_Items\" title=\"Category:Ranged Weapon Type Items\">Ranged Weapon</a> type item for <a href=\"/wiki/Dorf\" title=\"Dorf\">Dorf</a>. It costs 6 <span><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gold.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" src=\"/images/thumb/Gold.png/20px-Gold.png?192f9a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span> and is initially available.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Initial_Abilities\">Initial Abilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Item?action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Initial Abilities\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><b>On hit:</b>\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gain 20 <span><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Armor_Items\" title=\"Armor\"><img alt=\"Armor\" src=\"/images/thumb/Armor.png/20px-Armor.png?6c7e3c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Can only be thrown once per battle<br /></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Level_Up_Bonus\">Level Up Bonus</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Item?action=edit&amp;section=T-2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Level Up Bonus\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"itemTable\" style=\"text-align: center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n   <th>Level</th>\n   <th>Bonus</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n   <td>2</td>\n   <td>Gain +1  <span><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Damage_Items\" title=\"Damage\"><img alt=\"Damage\" src=\"/images/thumb/Damage.png/20px-Damage.png?9114aa\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n   <td>3</td>\n   <td>Gain 5% <span><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Crit_Chance_Items\" title=\"Crit Chance\"><img alt=\"Crit Chance\" src=\"/images/thumb/Crit_Chance.png/20px-Crit_Chance.png?fa0c55\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n   <td>4</td>\n   <td>Gain 10% <spa